<div style=3D"padding: 10px 4px;">
<p>1.The Third-Dimensional Flexible Angle Iron Welding Platform with Enhanc=
ed Efficiency is a new product offering quick positioning, makes fixture ac=
cessories easier to access, while improving overall welding performance. Th=
is makes it an ideal tool for welding professionals.</p>
<p>2.This versatile welding platform is designed to be used with a TIG weld=
ing mode, making it suitable for a wide range of welding projects. The 220V=
 input voltage and 50A current ensures it can power through even the toughe=
st welding tasks.</p>
<p>3.Made from high-quality materials, the platform is built to last. It is=
 made from cast iron, din st52-3, or steel, making it strong enough to hold=
 heavy weights and withstand the heat generated during the welding process.=
 The welding jig has a rated capacity of 50Hz and a rated duty cycle of 100=
%, ensuring stable performance and longevity. The dimensions of the platfor=
m are customizable to perfectly suit your workspace.</p>
<p>4.The quick positioning function, coupled with the flexibility to custom=
ize the size of the platform, makes it a flexible solution that can adapt t=
o any environment. It greatly facilitates efficient work, simplifying the p=
roduction process and reducing time on assembly lines.</p>
<p>5.Also, the Flexible Angle Iron Welding Platform from Mingdong is provid=
ed with a 1-year guarantee from the manufacturer, ensuring customers get a =
durable and reliable product to rely on. The platform is manufactured in Hu=
bei, China, and is shipped in good condition.</p>
</div>
